WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Here's a quick tip on how to customize your Positron layout exactly how you want it.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.700
The layout defaults with the editor above the console and the terminal below,

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.200
and the variables and plot panes to the right.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.900
So this is designed more for interactive workflows with scripts and quarto documents.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.100
But almost every component can be rearranged by dragging.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.100
So for example, you can try moving the Help pane into the Session pane,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.799
and you can also toggle most of these components in and out of view using commands

00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:31.100
such as ViewTogglePrimarySidebarVisibility.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.900
You can also use the CustomizeLayout command for more specific layout choices.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:41.500
So Stacked is the default, but you can also make it side-by-side or notebook layout.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.599
The Assistant layout makes Posit Assistant larger,

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:47.900
and the Agent layout puts it front and center.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.700
How do you have your Positron set up? Let us know.

